# Run with the coroutine connection handler, reactor-side parsing and
# reactor-side inline execution enabled.  The budget is raised far above
# cold-path first-execution cost so the 1s cooldown never engages during
# the test (the classifier cases below do not depend on the budget).
--thread-handling=coroutine-epoll
--coroutine-reactor-parse=ON
--coroutine-reactor-exec=ON
--coroutine-reactor-exec-budget-us=100000
--coroutine-reactor-threads=2
--coroutine-executor-threads=8
--skip-log-bin
